WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.760
This is the best time in history to make

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.839
tens of thousands of dollars a month

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.839
publishing content that's inspired by

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:09.760
someone else's content. Thousands of

00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:12.000
people out there, myself included, are

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:13.920
making real money just by posting about

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
