00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.680
got over 5 million followers posting

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.600
about business ideas because that's what

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.439
I'm interested in. But you can share

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.279
anything and build a following. Local

00:00:21.439 --> 00:00:24.720
events, hacks for tired parents,

00:00:23.279 --> 00:00:27.279
motorcycle reviews, power washing

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:29.599
videos, anything. The formula is simple.

00:00:27.279 --> 00:00:31.279
You pick a niche, you post consistently,

00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:34.000
and you build an audience, then you

00:00:31.279 --> 00:00:36.960
monetize. But most people get stuck on

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.719
finding fresh content ideas every single

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:41.120
day, multiple times a day. It can be a

00:00:38.719 --> 00:00:43.040
grind. And after this video of mine went

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:45.200
viral, I realized that's a problem that

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.719
people have. They need more inspiration.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.559
They need to know where to look

00:00:46.719 --> 00:00:50.160
consistently so they don't have to turn

00:00:48.559 --> 00:00:52.399
this into a full-time job. Because

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:55.600
without good systems, getting inspired

00:00:52.399 --> 00:00:57.120
by content to repurpose is exhausting.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:59.520
So today I'm going to build two

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:01.840
automations using AI tools that will do

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:03.440
all the research for me in my sleep.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:05.680
These tools are going to find what top

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:08.159
creators in my niche are posting about

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:10.240
and it'll send me a weekly report and

00:01:08.159 --> 00:01:12.560
you can copy everything I'm doing for

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:14.000
whatever niche you're interested in. So

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:16.240
today I'm going to show you exactly how

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.080
